t ice, it melts.","vi":"Làm nóng nước đá thì nó tan.","ipa":["ɪf","ju","hit","aɪs","ɪt","mɛlts"],"bad":{"en":"If you heat ice, it melt."},"b":10,"start":77.694,"end":79.514,"timing":[[0,77.694],[1,77.808],[2,77.961],[3,78.28],[4,78.808],[5,78.947]]},{"k":"n","sec":"mistakes","parts":[{"v":"Tiếng Việt hay bỏ chữ “nếu”, nhưng tiếng Anh cần "},{"e":"if"},{"v":" để nối hai vế."}],"b":11,"start":80.154,"end":84.664},{"k":"e","sec":"mistakes","en":"If I drink coffee, I can't sleep.","vi":"Uống cà phê là tôi không ngủ được.","ipa":["ɪf","aɪ","dɹɪŋk","ˈkɑfi","aɪ","kænt","slip"],"bad":{"en":"I drink coffee, I can't sleep."},"b":11,"start":85.204,"end":87.384,"timing":[[0,85.204],[1,85.328],[2,85.439],[3,85.772],[4,86.453],[5,86.606],[6,86.939]]},{"k":"e","sec":"dialogue","en":"Grandpa, what happens if you put a plant in a dark room?","vi":"Ông ơi, để cây trong phòng tối thì sao ạ?","ipa":["ˈɡɹændˌpɑ","wʌt","ˈhæpənz","ɪf","ju","pʊt","ə","plænt","ɪn","ə","dɑɹk","ɹum"],"who":"lily","ann":{"expression":"thinking"},"b":12,"start":88.524,"end":92.124,"timing":[[0,88.524],[1,89.304],[2,89.508],[3,90.092],[4,90.255],[5,90.378],[6,90.595],[7,90.69],[8,91.125],[9,91.274],[10,91.37],[11,91.723]]},{"k":"e","sec":"dialogue","en":"If plants don't get sunlight, they don't grow.","vi":"Nếu không có ánh nắng, cây không lớn được.","ipa":["ɪf","plænts","doʊnt","ɡɛt","ˈsʌnˌlaɪt","ðeɪ","doʊnt","ɡɹoʊ"],"who":"grandpa","ann":{"gesture":"explain"},"b":12,"start":92.914,"end":96.024,"timing":[[0,92.914],[1,93.047],[2,93.523],[3,93.806],[4,94.029],[5,95.056],[6,95.219],[7,95.472]]},{"k":"e","sec":"dialogue","en":"So plants are like me. If I don't eat, I don't grow!","vi":"Vậy cây giống cháu. Cháu không ăn thì cháu không lớn!","ipa":["soʊ","plænts","ɑɹ","laɪk","mi","ɪf","aɪ","doʊnt","it","aɪ","doʊnt","ɡɹoʊ"],"who":"lily","ann":{"expression":"happy"},"b":12,"start":96.814,"end":101.704,"timing":[[0,96.814],[1,97.082],[2,97.639],[3,97.842],[4,98.169],[5,99.464],[6,99.695],[7,99.831],[8,100.225],[9,100.8